//www.imdb.com/title/tt0099423/mediaviewer/rm3570112768/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vdb5.js","search_text":"特写高反差动作构图，冷蓝与暖橙色强光在人物挂彩的脸庞上交织，将孤胆英雄浴血奋战后的狂野与悲壮烘托到极致。\nNighttime snow close-up, a bloodied grime-covered man grimaces and yells amidst glowing orange flames and blue bokeh lights in the dark.\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-435f5ecc5cd4085e","w":22222,"sc":"绿树环绕的户外草坪前，身穿黄色消防员防护服的简正张开双臂紧紧拥抱浓妆黑衣的夏延","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261021","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f47cdac16f331971","frame_id":"IM-src-f47cdac16f331971-rm2063904256-02","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQxNTU3ODI5OF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjQ3NTI2OA@@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1440345/mediaviewer/rm2063904256/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vd43.js","search_text":"中景双人镜头将身穿厚重消防制服的妻子与哥特装扮的丈夫并置在明媚的郊外绿荫下，奇妙的反差感中饱含着中年伴侣间深沉宽容的爱意。\n横向室外中景剧照，背景是郁郁葱葱的绿色树木与草地。弗兰西斯·麦克道曼饰演的妻子简身穿带有反光条的厚重土黄色消防员工作服，正满怀深情地伸出双臂将丈夫夏延拥入怀中；西恩·潘饰演的夏延依旧顶着蓬松黑发与红唇，安静地依偎在妻子肩头，柔和的日光洒在两人身上，画面温情而独特。\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-eeb00c6b228a990e","w":22222,"sc":"玻璃门廊外，留着夸张蓬松黑发、涂着鲜红唇膏并身穿黑色西装的夏延正神情木然地站立","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261021","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f47cdac16f331971","frame_id":"IM-src-f47cdac16f331971-rm2080681472-01","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjAzMDE3NTIzNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMTQ3NTI2OA@@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1440345/mediaviewer/rm2080681472/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vdee.js","search_text":"中景正面构图以近乎对称的玻璃门框框住西恩·潘极具视觉冲击力的哥特摇滚老兵造型，苍白面容上的鲜红唇彩流露出滑稽而又心碎的荒诞感。\n横向中景剧照，由西恩·潘饰演的过气哥特摇滚歌手夏延站在现代建筑的玻璃门外，他顶着一头高高耸起的凌乱乌黑长发，苍白松弛的脸上画着浓重眼线与鲜艳红唇，身穿一套略显局促的黑色西装并提着随身包。他双肩微耸、神情呆滞而脆弱地望向镜头方向，玻璃门反射出浅淡的户外天光。\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-ccd38589c59925e1","w":22222,"sc":"温暖的室内灯光下，浓妆黑发的夏延与金发短发的妻子简并肩而坐，一同神情专注地望向画面左侧","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261021","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f47cdac16f331971","frame_id":"IM-src-f47cdac16f331971-rm796306944-03","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY0NjM3Nzc0N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODMyNzk1OA@@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1440345/mediaviewer/rm796306944/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vdcc.js","search_text":"中近景双人构图通过温暖柔和的琥珀色室内光线消解了主角怪异妆容的疏离感，夫妻二人默契一致的凝视方向展现出相濡以沫的家庭温情。\n横向室内中近景剧照，夏延与妻子简并肩坐在温暖的房间内，左侧的夏延留着蓬松黑发与鲜红唇妆，身穿黑色上衣；右侧的简留着利落的金色短发，身穿深色V领毛衣，脸庞贴近丈夫肩头。两人不约而同地将目光投向画面左前方，神情平静而温和，暖黄色灯光赋予画面宁静的居家质感。\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-6bcbbc6ba1fe6e06","w":22223,"sc":"竖幅访谈近景中满头银发戴眼镜的意大利老导演身穿米色西装激动地比划双手","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261021","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f47daac5db84dc13","frame_id":"IM-src-f47daac5db84dc13-rm1219386113-01","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYzkyNWQ2NDktZmY2OS00NWYwLThlYmItNzMwYTY4OThlNjY5XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt24657304/mediaviewer/rm1219386113/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vd6b.js","search_text":"采用人物纪录片生动传神的竖幅半身肖像构图，意大利新现实主义名导朱塞佩·德·桑蒂斯一头蓬松白发、佩戴琥珀色镜框眼镜，身穿浅米色休闲西装内搭深色衬衫，正抬起双手绘声绘色地讲述电影创作理念。\nA vertical indoor medium close-up portrait of elderly white-haired director Giuseppe De Santis in glasses and a beige blazer gesturing expressively with both hands.\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-8d4b98793c75acb0","w":22224,"sc":"黑白维多利亚书房内，左侧身穿礼服的杰基尔医生与右侧戴女仆帽的年轻女仆面对面近距离凝视，气氛暧昧紧绷。","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261020","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f480ab064e2eee8c","frame_id":"IM-src-f480ab064e2eee8c-rm2886831616-03","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTgxNTE1MzcwNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODkyNDAxMw@@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117002/mediaviewer/rm2886831616/","verification":"观图待人工核","tag_status":"待标注","detail_file":"vd8d.js","search_text":"近景黑白双人侧面构图利用背景窗光将两人框定在咫尺之间，主仆之间逾越阶级界限的灵魂吸引与善恶分裂的人性深渊在此交汇。\nBlack-and-white close-up two-shot in a Victorian parlor, John Malkovich on the left and housemaid Julia Roberts on the right facing each other closely.\n","review":"Antigravity 逐帧观图核验 (2026-10-20)","review_version":"antigravity-visual-audit-v1"},{"size":"","angle":"","frame":"","lens_type":"","dof":"","ld":"","time":"","weather":"","ie":"","pos":"","move":[],"light":[],"loc":[],"color":[],"comp":[],"emo":[],"id":"VS-335370fcd090abab","w":22224,"sc":"烛光微弱的古典卧室内，散开一头红棕长发、身披深色披肩的女仆静静伫立，神情忧伤而深沉地凝视左前方。","pl":"","ep":"","pal":[],"fk":"","st":"待核","add":"20261020","origin":"visual","source_work_id":"src-f480ab064e2eee8c","frame_id":"IM-src-f480ab064e2eee8c-rm729438976-02","source_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTgyMzQzMTEyM15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMTY3NzIwNDI@._V1_.jpg","source_page":"https://www.imdb.com/title/t